---
args: {"request": "ExceptionCase", "analogies": "RationaleAnalogy[]", "boundaries": "WaiverBoundary[]", "hearing": "ExceptionHearing"}
returns: "ExceptionArgument"
---
Identify the current rule and exact proposed deviation. For every mandatory condition bind finding = testDecisiveCondition(condition, request, hearing.caseHistory), where condition is the actual stated prerequisite. Collect findings; a decisive unknown yields clarify, a contradicted required condition yields deny unless an independently authorized different deviation is being requested. A governance defect such as absent expiry yields governance-repair. Grant can be recommended only within supported current authority, established conditions, explicit expiry and surviving controls. Keep unfavorable precedents in the explanation rather than suppressing them.
